[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=57 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="回程的推车卡在走廊接缝上。弗莱彻扶住档案箱，拉姆森蹲下去看轮轴，你伸手想帮忙，她指了指旁边那把椅子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="不是让你坐。把椅背朝我，借它垫一下。对，就这样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="轮轴上缠着一条细鱼线，绷得很紧。拉姆森试着剪开，剪刀没进去，莫里便从后面把车抬起一点。那一截走廊很窄，你们谁也没法绕过谁，只能等她慢慢处理。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="先放下吧，你手又在抖。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我没抬车。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我说箱子。你从码头一直抱到现在，弗莱彻不是说过她提吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你才发现自己把装记录的薄箱攥得太紧，纸角压进掌心。你松开一点，手指没有马上恢复知觉。弗莱彻接过箱子，放到窗边没有漏水的那块台面上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我刚才在想，要不要先离开第五小队。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里把车放回地板。拉姆森没有停下剪线的动作，弗莱彻也没有立即说不。走廊另一头有人推门，她们便先往旁边让了让，等端着热水的人走过去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="离开以后，准备去哪儿？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="还没想好。先去岸上的临时住处，或者别的码头。总比让你们一直担保好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="岸上的临时住处也要登记。你换一栋房子，门房不会就忘了问名字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我不是想躲登记。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那你得把后面半句说出来。我听见的只是你要走，还没听见为什么非得今天走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你望向档案箱。那截红线被单独夹在纸页间，没有颜色变深，也没有自己移动。可你只要看见它，就会想起箱子打开时无线电里那一点低音。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="箱子里有什么，我不知道。我跟它有没有关系，也不知道。你们已经因为我被问过一遍了。要是下一次有人拿这个追究呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="下一次该怎么答，我们可以现在商量。你自己搬走，不能替我们把答复也写完。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="可你是队长。出了事，他们不会只问我。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="对。所以我得知道你为什么离开，怎么联系，还有今天晚上谁给你开门。这几件事，你现在一件也答不上来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她说得不重，听上去更像在核对一张还没填全的出航单。你本来准备了一句“我自己承担”，忽然不知道该把它放在哪里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我倒觉得，换个住处可以考虑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你抬起头。弗莱彻也看向她。莫里在窗边挪开一个接雨的盆，用鞋尖把盆底摆平，免得它继续滴答敲地板。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="不是现在就走。码头人多，今天谁来过谁都看得见。以后如果一直有人盯着第五队，把他放在这儿未必合适。队长，我们也不能只因为舍不得人，就说这里最好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我没说永远留在这里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那就说清楚。我听了半天，还以为我们已经替他把之后几年的床都订好了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我也没说不想住。我只是……我现在连一个能证明身份的东西都没有，却已经让别人把名字写在担保人那一栏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯从楼梯口回来，手里拿着两张复印纸。她原本要找弗莱彻签字，听见最后一句，先把纸翻过去，免得被雨点打湿。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="担保写的是暂住和接受核查，没有写你从前没有做过任何事。我们没法知道的，不会替你保证。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="旧金山也是这样写的？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="你自己看。副本留给你，本来就是让你知道别人签了什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把纸递过来。你看了两遍，没有找到一句把你的过去说得很干净的话，也没有找到你担心的那句“由第五队承担一切责任”。有的地方留着空格，后面印着补充材料的期限。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我以为你们已经替我做了更大的保证。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们答应配合调查，也答应不把一个还在发烧的人送回海里。其他的话，没经你同意，不该替你说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森终于剪断鱼线，把那一小团卷在剪刀柄上。她没把线扔在地上，而是拿废纸包好，塞进修理袋的外层。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="车能走了。吵架可以边推边吵，别把去食堂的路一直堵着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我们在商量。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="那商量的时候给轮子留点地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们重新扶住车。走到下一个转角，莫里问你，如果今晚不走，最担心哪一件事。这次你没有先说会不会连累别人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我担心你们问起以前的事，我会忍不住编一个比较好听的答案。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里看了你一下，没有笑。她握住车把的手挪开一点，给你留出了另一边。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那你可以先说想一想。你不欠我一个立刻好听的答案。不过真想起什么危险的，别因为怕我皱眉就一直藏着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="要是临时编号一直换不了，我连找份工都得让别人替我解释。我怎么知道自己能住到什么时候？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="先问眼前那几天。修理间缺人抄分拣单，你愿意的话，明早跟拉姆森去看看。嫌脏嫌累也可以回来讲，别还没去就替她说不收你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她停下来等弗莱彻把箱子往车中央移。箱底碰到旧木板，发出一声很闷的响，你下意识伸手扶住，直到箱子稳了才放开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="今晚先住原来的地方。明天我陪你问另外的住处，问清以后由你选。调查照常，不会因为搬走就结束，也不会因为留下就算你认了什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我可以自己去问吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。出门告诉值班的人一声，带上副本。找不到门口，回来叫我。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_47"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="还有，别拿这张原件去给每个人看。我另外给你一张通行副本，不包括档案内容。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_48"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

